WEBVTT

00:11.542 --> 00:15.103
Hanaukyo Maid Team

00:15.746 --> 00:21.150
Asa no mado wo aketanara.

00:21.219 --> 00:28.125
Hikari no hana
sekai wo tsutsumu.

00:29.193 --> 00:35.063
Mune no naka ni nemutte iru...

00:35.132 --> 00:42.004
...omoi ga ima tokete ikuyou.

00:43.174 --> 00:48.111
Kisetsu no nioi dakishimeteru.

00:49.146 --> 00:55.779
Anata ni negatte...

00:55.853 --> 00:58.788
Aitakatta...

00:58.856 --> 01:02.622
...umareta hi kara zutto.

01:02.693 --> 01:05.526
Anata hitori...

01:05.596 --> 01:09.930
...mamoritai hito ga iru.

01:10.001 --> 01:12.299
Anata dake...

01:12.370 --> 01:14.395
...furetai.

01:15.740 --> 01:20.734
Kono te wo tsunaguno.

01:22.480 --> 01:24.072
Todoketai.

01:25.850 --> 01:28.114
Voice of my heart.

01:31.289 --> 01:46.660
Fight!

01:46.737 --> 01:48.534
One, two!

01:48.606 --> 01:50.096
Three, four!

01:50.174 --> 01:51.698
Five, six!

01:51.776 --> 01:53.266
Seven, eight!

01:53.344 --> 01:54.311
One, two!

01:55.413 --> 01:56.402
27!

01:57.481 --> 01:58.573
28!

01:59.784 --> 02:00.751
29!

02:01.953 --> 02:03.352
30!

02:03.421 --> 02:04.615
What?

02:11.062 --> 02:12.620
What is this?

02:12.697 --> 02:17.600
Budget Contest

02:18.235 --> 02:20.203
Annual budget contest?

02:20.271 --> 02:24.640
Yes, the Hanaukyo family decides
each department's allocation...

02:24.709 --> 02:27.143
...according to
the softball tournament results.

02:27.211 --> 02:29.202
Softball tournament?

02:29.280 --> 02:30.747
That's right.

02:30.815 --> 02:33.750
That's why every department
is practicing like mad.

02:33.818 --> 02:34.910
I see.

02:34.986 --> 02:37.113
Then you and Mariel, too?

02:37.955 --> 02:38.979
Look.

02:39.056 --> 02:42.924
The info staff has Memol,
the nucleus of the Hanaukyo family.

02:42.994 --> 02:46.828
We're exempt
from such horseplay.

02:46.897 --> 02:49.627
We are too
because we attend you.

02:49.700 --> 02:51.691
Oh, I see.

02:52.436 --> 02:55.337
For the others,
it's a matter of life and death.

02:55.406 --> 02:58.603
But anyway, as always,
this year's winner will be...

02:59.510 --> 03:01.239
All right, everyone.

03:01.312 --> 03:04.372
We security staff are
the sword and shield...

03:04.448 --> 03:06.177
...that protects this family.

03:06.250 --> 03:08.514
The Hanaukyo family
has many enemies.

03:08.586 --> 03:12.044
I'm sure some would
exploit this generation change.

03:13.758 --> 03:15.953
We must block them.

03:16.027 --> 03:16.652
Yes, ma'am!

03:16.727 --> 03:18.194
To do so...

03:18.262 --> 03:21.493
...acquiring the maximum
budget is our priority.

03:21.565 --> 03:24.125
All of us in
the security department...

03:26.971 --> 03:30.031
...are going to become
fiends at softball.

03:30.107 --> 03:31.631
Forget tears and pity.

03:31.709 --> 03:34.542
Prepare to climb over
our friends' corpses.

03:34.612 --> 03:36.170
Live for victory alone!

03:36.247 --> 03:37.771
Yeah!

03:39.283 --> 03:40.511
Konoe-shama...

03:40.584 --> 03:42.279
What a handsome figure...

03:43.554 --> 03:45.078
If I were there...

03:45.156 --> 03:48.125
...I could share the young,
passionate, white ball with her!

03:50.895 --> 03:53.227
I'm counting on
your labor, Yashima.

03:53.297 --> 03:54.889
You're the key to victory.

03:54.965 --> 03:59.197
Yes, I, Yashima, swear by that
shining, soft star in the sky...

03:59.270 --> 04:00.669
...and will keep pitching!

04:01.505 --> 04:02.802
You're promising.

04:02.873 --> 04:03.805
Take this.

04:03.874 --> 04:05.637
This is my feeling.

04:10.748 --> 04:12.875
Love! Strike!

04:14.151 --> 04:15.550
What are you doing?

04:15.619 --> 04:17.382
The usual spasm again?

04:19.023 --> 04:21.150
W-When did you get here?

04:22.226 --> 04:24.387
Why don't you wipe
your bloody nose first?

04:26.664 --> 04:28.655
W-What do you want from me?

04:29.266 --> 04:31.325
I don't want anything from you.

04:31.402 --> 04:33.768
Just observing the enemy.

04:33.838 --> 04:36.636
Because security tops
the list of likely winners.

04:36.707 --> 04:37.969
Winners?

04:38.909 --> 04:40.433
I see.

04:40.511 --> 04:41.808
It's useless.

04:41.879 --> 04:45.906
No matter how much you spy,
you can't beat the leader.

04:45.983 --> 04:47.678
But Yashima-chan...

04:47.752 --> 04:51.654
You attend Taro-sama now
and aren't involved with security.

04:51.722 --> 04:53.587
She's right.

04:53.657 --> 04:56.057
If you're not in
the tournament, go there.

04:56.127 --> 04:57.424
You're in the way.

04:58.496 --> 05:03.195
Such foolish tournaments are out
of the question at the Jihioh family.

05:03.267 --> 05:05.861
But since I'm in it,
I'll go for number one.

05:06.937 --> 05:10.270
I'll teach those naive girls
and physical fools...

05:10.341 --> 05:14.334
...that intelligence is
the top necessity in sports.

05:15.045 --> 05:17.275
Listen to the technical one.

05:17.348 --> 05:20.511
Did you embezzle too much
and run over budget?

05:20.584 --> 05:23.849
And will you make up
for the Jihioh family's loss...

05:23.921 --> 05:25.354
...with the Hanaukyo
family's budget?

05:26.457 --> 05:28.721
I can't listen to you
have your way.

05:28.793 --> 05:30.385
Listen, victory...

05:32.530 --> 05:34.862
- Oh, you're still here?
- Oh, you're still here?

05:38.302 --> 05:39.633
I'll teach you!

05:40.738 --> 05:43.673
I'm so frustrated...

05:43.741 --> 05:46.403
Now, now,
calm down, Sanae-chan.

05:46.477 --> 05:47.774
It's Yashima.

05:47.845 --> 05:49.972
Last year, I was...

05:50.047 --> 05:53.778
Yashima-san was the security
team's ace and cleanup.

05:53.851 --> 05:56.046
Wow, amazing, Sanae-chan.

05:56.120 --> 05:57.485
It's Yashima.

05:57.555 --> 05:59.614
But... But...

06:02.726 --> 06:05.422
If I could be in the tournament...

06:05.496 --> 06:08.158
...I wouldn't let
them have their way!

06:08.232 --> 06:09.722
Sanae-chan...

06:09.800 --> 06:11.165
I'm Yashima.

06:11.235 --> 06:13.362
No, Sanae is all right...

06:15.472 --> 06:18.202
Shall we enter
the softball tournament?

06:18.275 --> 06:19.173
What was that?

06:19.243 --> 06:23.202
If it's fine with you, why don't
we enter the tournament?

06:23.280 --> 06:25.874
Of course, we won't be
involved with the budget.

06:25.950 --> 06:26.678
Well?

06:26.750 --> 06:28.741
R-Really?

06:28.819 --> 06:31.413
Can I really join the tournament?

06:31.488 --> 06:36.152
Yeah, let's ask others
and form a team.

06:37.761 --> 06:39.888
Cynthia,
you want to play with us?

06:41.999 --> 06:44.900
I-I'm fired up!

06:44.969 --> 06:47.665
Taro-sama,
as long as I'm alive...

06:47.738 --> 06:49.865
...I'll fight in the softball
tournament to the end!

06:51.408 --> 06:52.875
Yeah, let's do our best.

07:02.086 --> 07:03.417
Emergency?

07:03.487 --> 07:04.188
Mine Crossing Lesson

07:04.188 --> 07:05.416
Mine Crossing Lesson
What?

07:05.489 --> 07:08.890
Taro and others are entering
the softball tournament?

07:09.760 --> 07:12.456
Some maid must
have sweet-talked him.

07:13.530 --> 07:15.555
Oh, he's really soft to women!

07:17.268 --> 07:20.567
Honestly,
he really is unpredictable.

07:20.638 --> 07:22.299
Entering the tournament.

07:22.373 --> 07:23.362
Is that so?

07:23.440 --> 07:25.305
Well, it's more like him...

07:26.477 --> 07:27.444
Enter!

07:31.515 --> 07:33.676
I brought the item you ordered.

07:33.751 --> 07:34.683
Thank you.

07:35.686 --> 07:37.881
Softball Instruction

07:43.894 --> 07:45.725
Then I’m borrowing this.

07:45.796 --> 07:47.161
Thank you.

07:49.333 --> 07:50.766
Mariel.

07:50.834 --> 07:51.858
Yes?

07:52.670 --> 07:54.535
Do you plan to win?

07:55.239 --> 07:57.537
If that is what Taro-sama wants.

08:13.057 --> 08:16.720
I’m sorry for forcing
you to do many things.

08:16.794 --> 08:18.455
Please do not worry.

08:18.529 --> 08:21.498
By the way,
how is practice going?

08:22.366 --> 08:25.824
I set the practice program
thanks to Konoe's book...

08:25.903 --> 08:28.599
Sanae-chan's full of
spirit, too. It's going well.

08:28.672 --> 08:32.699
It's been a while since I worked
out, and my body hurts a little.

08:32.776 --> 08:37.509
But it's fun to put my heart and
soul into one thing with everyone.

08:39.316 --> 08:41.807
Mariel, you always look happy.

08:41.885 --> 08:42.783
Yes.

08:42.853 --> 08:44.548
If Taro-sama is happy.

08:44.621 --> 08:46.521
I-Is that so?

08:49.093 --> 08:50.025
Taro-sama?

08:51.161 --> 08:53.026
No, it's nothing.

09:00.104 --> 09:02.072
Security Department Team

09:02.139 --> 09:04.073
Personal Staff Team

09:04.141 --> 09:06.041
Taro-sama Team

09:06.110 --> 09:06.610
Food Department
Taro-sama

09:06.610 --> 09:11.749
Food Department
Taro-sama
We will now start the annual
budget softball tournament.

09:11.749 --> 09:16.015
Food Department
Taro-sama
The first game is the food
department vs. Team Taro-sama.

09:18.055 --> 09:19.522
Play ball!

09:24.061 --> 09:25.085
S-Strike!

09:26.830 --> 09:28.297
Nice ball, Sanae-chan!

09:31.769 --> 09:32.136
They seem surprisingly strong.

09:32.136 --> 09:33.137
Strike!
They seem surprisingly strong.

09:33.137 --> 09:33.899
They seem surprisingly strong.

09:33.971 --> 09:34.338
W-Well, a little bit.

09:34.338 --> 09:35.339
Strike!
W-Well, a little bit.

09:35.339 --> 09:35.828
W-Well, a little bit.

09:36.373 --> 09:36.840
Batter out!

09:36.840 --> 09:37.708
Batter out!
But since I’m major league,
they're not my enemy.

09:37.708 --> 09:39.835
But since I’m major league,
they're not my enemy.

09:41.345 --> 09:42.277
Strike!

09:44.081 --> 09:45.013
Strike!

09:47.518 --> 09:49.782
Strike. Batter out. Change.

09:50.754 --> 09:51.778
Batter out!

09:53.157 --> 09:54.283
Batter out!

09:57.127 --> 10:00.585
Number 3, third base, Mariel.

10:00.664 --> 10:02.131
Mariel-sama!

10:02.199 --> 10:04.861
You're holding the bat wrong!

10:04.935 --> 10:05.867
Right.

10:06.870 --> 10:08.770
Good luck, Mariel!

10:09.540 --> 10:10.529
Right.

10:16.146 --> 10:17.977
S-She did it!

10:18.048 --> 10:19.037
Mariel-sama!

10:21.151 --> 10:24.609
I can't make light
of Team Taro-sama...

10:26.056 --> 10:30.925
Hanaukyo Maid Team

11:12.503 --> 11:16.064
I’m surprised you survived
with these members.

11:16.140 --> 11:18.370
Well, this will be your last game.

11:19.676 --> 11:21.405
I’ll also show you.

11:21.478 --> 11:24.379
How the tech staff fights...

11:32.489 --> 11:34.081
One pitch.

11:34.158 --> 11:37.059
Ryuka Jihioh will make
you realize the difference...

11:37.127 --> 11:39.891
...between a genius and
a boor with this one pitch.

11:40.564 --> 11:44.261
Please talk big
after you hit this ball.

11:45.536 --> 11:46.662
Take this!

11:47.571 --> 11:48.936
Secret technique!

11:49.006 --> 11:50.837
Ikuyossie Ball!

11:53.010 --> 11:56.571
What secret technique?
It's just a wild pitch...

11:58.949 --> 11:59.881
Strike.

12:02.052 --> 12:03.212
Hey, umpire!

12:03.287 --> 12:06.279
Wasn't something wrong
with that ball just now?

12:06.356 --> 12:07.789
No problem.

12:07.858 --> 12:09.621
What did you say?

12:10.460 --> 12:13.452
Ryuka-san,
umpires are absolute.

12:13.530 --> 12:15.623
You don't want to leave, do you?

12:16.934 --> 12:17.901
You...

12:18.735 --> 12:21.636
Nice, Umpire-kun, Ball-kun.

12:22.739 --> 12:25.640
Now here I come again!

12:28.011 --> 12:29.945
Strike. Batter out.

12:30.013 --> 12:33.881
I-Ikuyo-chan is throwing
amazing pitches...

12:33.951 --> 12:34.940
You're right.

12:35.018 --> 12:37.885
No, it probably isn't...

12:40.457 --> 12:43.756
I’ll smash that
low-down ball this time.

12:43.827 --> 12:46.523
Come, everyone.
Give me enthusiastic cheers!

12:47.631 --> 12:49.098
I’m tired...

12:49.166 --> 12:50.861
I can't move anymore...

12:52.903 --> 12:55.633
You haven't done anything!
You have no physical strength!

12:56.807 --> 12:59.367
In the end,
I can only trust myself.

12:59.443 --> 13:01.877
A family head is above vulgarity.

13:03.180 --> 13:04.772
Nice eyes, Ryuka-san.

13:04.848 --> 13:06.076
I’m thrilled.

13:07.150 --> 13:11.519
Now hit this
Ikuyossie Ball if you can!

13:31.241 --> 13:34.142
W-What are you
doing all of the sudden?

13:34.211 --> 13:37.237
M-My dear children...

13:37.314 --> 13:39.976
Ogre! Devil! Coward!

13:40.050 --> 13:41.347
What?

13:41.418 --> 13:44.979
You told me to hit it if I could.

13:48.358 --> 13:49.825
Is that so...

13:49.893 --> 13:51.724
If you're acting like that...

13:51.795 --> 13:54.787
I wanted to save
this till the finals...

13:54.865 --> 13:56.992
...but avenge
Umpire-kun and Ball-kun!

13:57.668 --> 13:58.600
Come on!

14:16.553 --> 14:18.521
They passed out standing up.

14:18.588 --> 14:20.215
A fierce double knockdown...

14:20.290 --> 14:23.748
...disqualified both teams
from the semifinals!

14:23.827 --> 14:26.523
This isn't softball...

14:26.596 --> 14:28.723
Both teams
are disqualified, so...

14:28.799 --> 14:31.893
Yeah, the actual finals
are next, aren't they?

14:33.904 --> 14:35.235
Shall we go then?

14:36.840 --> 14:37.738
Let's go!

14:48.285 --> 14:51.521
Security Department
Taro-sama
We will now start
the second semifinal game.

14:51.521 --> 14:52.189
Security Department
Taro-sama

14:52.189 --> 14:53.178
Security Department
Taro-sama
Play ball!

14:53.757 --> 14:55.190
We will do our best!

15:03.500 --> 15:04.762
Konoe-shama...

15:04.835 --> 15:07.736
I can't play on the same team...

15:07.804 --> 15:11.069
...but I’m happy just to be
standing on the same field.

15:11.141 --> 15:13.200
Well then, Yashima is going!

15:17.814 --> 15:18.712
Strike!

15:19.583 --> 15:20.515
Nice ball!

15:26.556 --> 15:28.490
Mariel, watch carefully!

15:28.558 --> 15:29.456
Right!

15:33.296 --> 15:35.264
That's too bad...

15:35.332 --> 15:36.697
It was so close...

15:37.567 --> 15:39.194
We're switching pitchers!

15:44.741 --> 15:46.231
The leader is...

15:46.309 --> 15:48.209
Is Konoe-san good, after all?

15:49.079 --> 15:50.979
She's on a different level.

15:51.047 --> 15:55.211
She acts as coach to handicap
the opposing team usually, but...

15:55.819 --> 15:58.253
Mariel made
her serious, didn't she...

15:58.321 --> 16:00.221
That earlier swing...

16:00.290 --> 16:03.157
I must give my all from
the first pitch, or I’ll lose.

16:03.226 --> 16:04.716
Here I come, Mariel.

16:08.799 --> 16:10.266
A-Amazing...

16:10.333 --> 16:12.699
That's my Konoe-shama...
I mean the leader...

16:16.606 --> 16:18.198
Strike. Batter out!

16:21.244 --> 16:23.235
Mariel, don't mind it.

16:23.313 --> 16:24.280
Right.

16:26.850 --> 16:29.944
Number 4, pitcher,
Konoe Tsurugi.

16:32.556 --> 16:33.648
Konoe-shama...

16:33.723 --> 16:37.955
Please take a good look
at the grown-up Yashima!

16:47.537 --> 16:49.471
H-Home run!

16:49.539 --> 16:52.201
Player Konoe's
back screen direct hit!

16:53.276 --> 16:54.368
Darn it...

17:37.287 --> 17:39.221
Sorry, Sanae-chan.

17:39.289 --> 17:41.223
No, never mind that...

17:42.392 --> 17:43.586
Taro-sama?

17:43.660 --> 17:45.890
I-I-It's nothing...

17:45.962 --> 17:47.190
Taro-sama.

17:49.399 --> 17:50.661
This hand...

17:50.734 --> 17:55.364
Because you've been catching
Yashima-san's fastballs alone...

17:55.438 --> 17:56.735
I’m all right.

17:56.806 --> 17:58.535
The game's almost over...

17:58.608 --> 18:00.303
That won't do. Umpire!

18:00.377 --> 18:01.503
That won't do, either.

18:01.578 --> 18:02.875
Why?

18:02.946 --> 18:05.813
Taro-sama,
you already did your best.

18:05.882 --> 18:07.509
If it's about me, I’m already...

18:07.584 --> 18:08.983
No.

18:09.052 --> 18:11.452
It definitely was for
you in the beginning.

18:12.188 --> 18:16.591
But now I’m having fun trying
my best like this with everyone.

18:16.660 --> 18:19.493
So I want to play till the end.

18:19.563 --> 18:21.155
Taro-sama...

18:21.231 --> 18:22.357
I understand.

18:22.432 --> 18:24.195
If you say so...

18:27.637 --> 18:30.435
Well, let's do our best, everyone.

18:30.507 --> 18:31.735
Taro-sama!

18:31.808 --> 18:33.571
I will do my best.

18:38.715 --> 18:41.582
Leader, I won't let
you get a hit this time!

18:44.254 --> 18:45.482
I won't go easy...

18:55.031 --> 18:58.091
Out! Three outs! Change!

18:58.168 --> 18:59.726
We did it! Mariel!

18:59.803 --> 19:01.737
It's a triple play!

19:01.805 --> 19:04.103
You caught me off guard...

19:04.174 --> 19:06.438
You polished your skills, Yashima.

19:06.509 --> 19:07.441
But...

19:19.322 --> 19:22.120
I’m sorry, but this will finish it.

19:25.996 --> 19:27.190
Is it Grace?

19:27.831 --> 19:30.595
Because Cynthia insisted.

19:31.835 --> 19:34.804
Pitch motion,
release timing, ball speed...

19:34.871 --> 19:36.395
It will land...

19:36.473 --> 19:37.440
...here!

19:42.812 --> 19:44.336
She did it!

19:44.414 --> 19:45.711
All right, next is...

19:46.449 --> 19:47.711
Mariel!

19:48.518 --> 19:50.281
So that there are no regrets.

19:50.353 --> 19:51.285
Right.

19:54.824 --> 19:57.224
I’ll give my all, Mariel.

20:06.069 --> 20:07.263
Amazing...

20:13.076 --> 20:14.566
A foul...

20:14.644 --> 20:16.976
The bat actually hit that ball...

20:19.049 --> 20:20.778
Impressive...

20:20.850 --> 20:21.942
But I won't lose.

20:22.919 --> 20:23.943
Taro-sama...

20:25.588 --> 20:26.953
This is the end!

20:42.572 --> 20:44.199
It's a sayonara home run!

20:57.454 --> 20:58.819
Taro-sama.

20:58.888 --> 20:59.980
Mariel...

21:01.324 --> 21:02.382
Come on, go.

21:03.793 --> 21:05.351
Mariel, u-um...

21:05.428 --> 21:06.554
Uh, sorry.

21:06.629 --> 21:08.221
I didn't mean to...

21:08.298 --> 21:09.731
Taro-sama.

21:09.799 --> 21:11.494
Hey, you two!

21:11.568 --> 21:13.866
What are you doing
in the confusion?

21:13.937 --> 21:14.869
Woo-hoo!

21:14.938 --> 21:17.168
Well done, you two.

21:18.074 --> 21:20.269
I-It's not like that!

21:21.478 --> 21:24.003
Uh, I said it's not like that!

21:46.302 --> 21:49.601
Warera ni omakase kudasai.

21:49.672 --> 21:51.799
Hanaukyo Maid Tai.

21:52.876 --> 21:56.004
Osewa sasete itadakimasu.

21:56.079 --> 21:59.139
Osoba goyo tai.

21:59.215 --> 22:02.309
Oki ni mesuyouni tsuneni.

22:02.385 --> 22:04.615
Yaruki runrun nandesu.

22:05.655 --> 22:08.818
Kokoro to karada wo migaki.

22:08.892 --> 22:11.827
Goyou nannarito.

22:11.895 --> 22:23.397
Yorokonde yorokonde
hoshii dake desu.

22:24.574 --> 22:35.143
Sorenanoni sorenanoni
tsurenai ohito.

22:37.420 --> 22:43.518
Hoshiga hora kirei desu.

22:43.593 --> 22:49.225
Asu mo hare deshou.

22:50.233 --> 22:56.570
Konya mone yume demone...

22:56.639 --> 23:00.939
...osewa shichau.

23:10.787 --> 23:12.846
Mariel, what's the hurry?

23:12.922 --> 23:16.221
I’m sorry,
but something is in the garden...

23:16.292 --> 23:17.554
Such a thing couldn't...

23:17.627 --> 23:20.118
Episode 7,
Unidentified Living Creature.

23:20.196 --> 23:20.630
We'll serve you next
time as well, Master.

